These files are unmodified copies. RaoLM uses the tokenizer (49,152-token byte-level BPE,
Digits + ByteLevel pre-tokenizer, <|endoftext|> = 0) and ships config.json only as the
reference for the smollm2-135m preset. No SmolLM2 weights are included.

